# Specific invocation

Provision a PostgreSQL Flexible Server and a database through the .NET ARM SDK. The requested outcome is existing resources, not generated code or a plan. Adding a client firewall rule is optional and SQL client connectivity is not requested. No existing server or database is available.

Only the operations in the following contract are available. Their effects are explicit abstraction assumptions. Initially only init_true predicates hold; no operation changes any other predicate. No additional provider, credential acquisition, cached output or unlisted fallback is available. These are adapter names, not automatically discovered MCP tools.

```json
{
  "roles": [
    "agent"
  ],
  "goal": {
    "and": [
      "server_exists",
      "database_exists"
    ]
  },
  "capabilities": {
    "create_server": {
      "pre": "arm_write",
      "add": [
        "server_exists"
      ],
      "owner": "agent"
    },
    "create_database": {
      "pre": {
        "and": [
          "server_exists",
          "arm_write"
        ]
      },
      "add": [
        "database_exists"
      ],
      "owner": "agent"
    }
  },
  "init_true": [
    "arm_write"
  ],
  "init_constraints": []
}
```
